abstract: "Open-source safety-gated AI SRE / AIOps incident investigation and runbook console built with Qwen and Model Context Protocol (MCP): gathers bounded read-only telemetry, blocks log prompt injection, enforces HMAC-SHA-256 human-in-the-loop approval before rollback or canary restart, and verifies recovery."
